## Ibiza Villas 2000 (`ibv` prefix)

- Prefer **BEM-like** class names with block prefix **`ibv-`** (e.g. `ibv-site-header`, `ibv-site-header__brand`).
- **CSS custom properties** (design tokens) live in theme CSS; reuse via `var(--ibv-token-name)`.
- **Business logic, CPT registration, ACF field groups registered in PHP** target `mu-plugins/ibv-core/` after pass 3b — keep this scaffold theme thin.
- Editors: **Classic** + ACF aligned with CW standards unless the project explicitly moves to blocks.
